  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zfojiw3.png\" width=\"728\" height=\"211\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"887\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">苦力怕大翻新將原版苦力怕替換成各種不同生態域專屬的苦力怕類型，有些比其他的更友善！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XIf8yMA1V2U?wmode=transparent\" width=\"327\" height=\"327\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>您可能也會對以下內容感興趣：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OMlhHaU.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul 資源包\" width=\"338\" height=\"71\"></a><br>由 lord_gogomines 製作的資源包，將苦力怕大翻新的苦力怕帶入原版 Minecraft！<br><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jUxOI3S.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">由 wadoo154 為苦力怕大翻新製作的粉絲動畫資源包</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術設計<br>ThatGravyBoat - 模組程式編寫<br>scratchy_sd - 所有苦力怕音效<br>ArkticBoi - 概念美術<br>thesamirmc - 標誌設計<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 一個在 Minecraft 中加入驚人生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 一個加入各種友善動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong> - 在你的世界中加入兩種友善的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Night Lights</a></strong>&nbsp;- 加入各種不同的裝飾性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 在遊戲中加入 60 種新的近戰武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a> </strong>- 一個翻新原版鐵魔像的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 一個翻新原版終界使者的模組！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></a>&nbsp;- 加入充滿小村民「蛙人」的沼澤村莊！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudnord.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLUVuvA.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"275\"></a></p>",
